**15.3.27**: \(=\!(1\!\pm\!\sqrt{z})^{-{\frac{1}{2}}}\!F(a,a\!-\!b+\!{\frac{1}{2}};2a\!-\!2 b\!+\!1;\,\pm 4\sqrt{z}(1\!\pm\!\sqrt{z})^{-{\frac{1}{2}}})\)
