**15.3.31**: \(F(a,\,1\!-\!a;\,e;\,z)\!=\!(1\!-\!z)^{-{\frac{1}{2}}}\!F({\frac{1}{2}}c\!-\!{ \frac{1}{2}}a,\,{\frac{1}{2}}c;\,{\frac{1}{2}}a\!-\!4z^{{\frac{1}{2}}})\)
**15.3.32**: \(=\!(1\!-\!z)^{{\frac{1}{2}}}(1\!-\!2z)^{a\!-\!e}F\left({\frac{1}{2}}c\!-\!{ \frac{1}{2}}a,\,{\frac{1}{2}}c\!-\!{\frac{1}{2}}a\!+\!{\frac{1}{2}};\,e;\,(4z^{ 2}\!-\!4z)(1\!-\!2z)^{-{\frac{1}{2}}}\right)\)

Cubic transformations are listed in [15.2] and [15.3].

In the formulas above, the square roots are defined so that their value is real and positive when \(0\leq z<1\). All formulas are valid in the neighborhood of \(z=0\).

